{"id":"f1534c00-0955-4eed-8c81-43bc1485e205","createdAt":"2026-10-27T05:16:25.303Z","batchId":"profile_deepseek-v4-1-flash-gateway_high","approach":"html","modelId":"deepseek-v4.1-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"high"},"presetId":"profile","prompt":"A user profile card with avatar, name, role, short bio, a few stats and a follow button.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\" style=\"max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;width:100%\">\n\n    <div>\n      <h1>Profile</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:.25rem\">How Amara's card appears to other members of the Northwind workspace.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:0;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div class=\"pf-band\"></div>\n\n      <div style=\"padding:0 1.5rem 1.5rem\">\n        <div class=\"row between\" style=\"align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.75rem;margin-top:-44px\">\n          <div class=\"avatar pf-avatar\">AM</div>\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-self:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n            <button class=\"btn\" id=\"followBtn\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Follow</button>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" type=\"button\" title=\"Open a direct message thread\">Message</button>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"More profile options\">⋯</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:.9rem\">\n          <h2 style=\"margin:0\">Amara Mensah</h2>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Verified</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:.25rem\">\n          Senior Product Designer · Design Systems at <strong>Northwind Labs</strong>\n        </p>\n\n        <p style=\"margin-top:.75rem\">\n          I design calm, accessible interfaces for data-heavy products. Currently leading the\n          design-system rebuild at Northwind — 42 components, one source of truth. Previously at\n          Lumen Health and Studio Kestrel.\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:.75rem\">\n          <span class=\"small muted\">Lisbon, Portugal</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">·</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">Joined March 2021</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">·</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">northwind.design/amara</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">·</span>\n          <span class=\"small up\">Replies in ~2h</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"followNote\" style=\"margin-top:.75rem\">\n          Follow Amara to get her projects and design-system updates in your feed.\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid cols-4 pf-stats\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"followerCount\" aria-live=\"polite\">2,398</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-label\">Followers</div>\n            <div class=\"small up\">+12 this week</div>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"stat-value\">318</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-label\">Following</div>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"stat-value\">27</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-label\">Projects</div>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"stat-value\">146</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-label\">Endorsements</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <div class=\"stat-label\">Focus areas</div>\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap\">\n            <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Design Systems</span>\n            <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Accessibility</span>\n            <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Data Visualisation</span>\n            <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Prototyping</span>\n            <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Design Tokens</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"row between\" style=\"align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;margin-top:1.25rem\">\n          <span class=\"small muted\">Member since March 2021 · 4 shared projects with you</span>\n          <span class=\"badge\">Open to collabs</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .pf-band {\n    height: 104px;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99, 102, 241, .38), rgba(56, 189, 248, .22) 55%, rgba(244, 114, 182, .20));\n  }\n  .pf-avatar {\n    width: 88px;\n    height: 88px;\n    font-size: 1.9rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: .02em;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .pf-stats .stat-value {\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 520px) {\n    .pf-avatar { width: 72px; height: 72px; font-size: 1.5rem; }\n    .pf-band { height: 84px; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<script>\n  (function () {\n    var BASE = 2398;\n    var following = false;\n\n    var btn = document.getElementById('followBtn');\n    var countEl = document.getElementById('followerCount');\n    var note = document.getElementById('followNote');\n\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      following = !following;\n\n      countEl.textContent = (BASE + (following ? 1 : 0)).toLocaleString('en-US');\n\n      if (following) {\n        btn.textContent = '✓ Following';\n        btn.className = 'btn btn-outline';\n        btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'true');\n        note.textContent = \"Following — Amara's updates now appear in your feed.\";\n      } else {\n        btn.textContent = 'Follow';\n        btn.className = 'btn';\n        btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false');\n        note.textContent = 'Follow Amara to get her projects and design-system updates in your feed.';\n      }\n    });\n  })();\n</script>","deltas":[[25137,"<div"],[25149," class"],[25159,"=\""],[25159,"page"],[25170,"\">\n"],[25170," "],[25170," <"],[25170,"div"],[25181," class"],[25192,"=\""],[25192,"stack"],[25192," gap"],[25192,"-lg"],[25202,"\""],[25202," style"],[25202,"=\""],[25202,"max"],[25202,"-width"],[25202,":"],[25219,"680"],[25229,"px"],[25229,";"],[25229,"margin"],[25229,":"],[25229,"0"],[25257," auto"],[25269,";"],[25269,"width"],[25269,":"],[25269,"100"],[25269,"%"],[25269,"\">\n\n"],[25269,"   "],[25269," <"],[25269,"div"],[25269,">\n"],[25269,"     "],[25270," <"],[25270,"h"],[25270,"1"],[25270,">"],[25270,"Profile"],[25278,"</"],[25288,"h"],[25288,"1"],[25288,">\n"],[25288,"     "],[25288," <"],[25298,"p"],[25298," class"],[25298,"=\""],[25298,"lead"],[25298,"\""],[25313," style"],[25326,"=\""],[25326,"margin"],[25326,"-top"],[25332,":."],[25332,"25"],[25344,"rem"],[25359,"\">"],[25359,"How"],[25359," Am"],[25363,"ara"],[25363,"'s"],[25376," card"],[25393," appears"],[25404," to"],[25414," other"],[25426," members"],[25436," of"],[25436," the"],[25436," North"],[25446,"wind"],[25446," workspace"],[25446,".</"],[25458,"p"],[25469,">\n"],[25469,"   "],[25469," </"],[25469,"div"],[25469,">\n\n"],[25493,"   "],[25502," <"],[25502,"div"],[25502," class"],[25502,"=\""],[25502,"card"],[25502,"\""],[25502," style"],[25502,"=\""],[25502,"padding"],[25512,":"],[25512,"0"],[25512,";"],[25512,"overflow"],[25512,":h"],[25512,"idden"],[25521,"\">\n"],[25521,"     "],[25521," <"],[25521,"div"],[25521," class"],[25521,"=\""],[25537,"pf"],[25549,"-band"],[25549,"\"></"],[25549,"div"],[